{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36697","headline":"夏州胡常侍 · 罗隐","name":"夏州胡常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百尺高台勃勃州，大刀长戟汉诸侯。\n征鸿过尽边云阔，战马闲来塞草秋。\n国计已推肝胆许，家财不爲子孙谋。\n仍闻陇蜀由多事，深喜将军未白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}